cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SparseElementaryDivisors.jl"
abstract: >-
  Elementary divisors (Smith normal form) of large sparse integer matrices, in Julia:
  exact sparse elimination with unit pivots (Markowitz-style pivot choice, parallel
  pivot search and fill-in, checked integer arithmetic), then Hecke on the remaining core.
authors:
